{
  "name": "RAG Ingestion v5 — Production-Ready (Gruppe 1, Case 1)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## INGESTION v5 — Production-Ready\n\n7 Patterns aus EIP (Hohpe/Woolf, 2003) + SRE Book (Google, 2016):\n\n1. Schema Validation (pre-process)\n2. Audit Logs (Supabase audit_events)\n3. DLQ (failed_jobs Tabelle)\n4. Structured Logging (JSON)\n5. Rate Limit Handling (Wait + Backoff)\n6. Circuit Breaker (per Service)\n7. Idempotency (file_hash check)\n\nKein HMAC hier (Manual Trigger). Siehe Query-Workflow für HMAC.",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 1440,
        "color": "#0773C5"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 0],
      "id": "sticky-header-ingestion",
      "name": "Header"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [128, 528],
      "id": "manual-trigger",
      "name": "Start Ingestion"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "read",
        "fileSelector": "/Users/stm/.n8n-files/company-docs/**/*.md",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.readWriteFile",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [352, 528],
      "id": "read-files",
      "name": "Read MD Files"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Pattern 1: Schema Validation\n// Pattern 4: Structured Logging\n// Pattern 7: Idempotency (file_hash)\n\nconst crypto = require('crypto');\nconst items = $input.all();\nconst validated = [];\nconst skipped = [];\n\nconst MAX_FILE_BYTES = 10 * 1024 * 1024; // 10 MB\nconst MIN_CONTENT_LEN = 50;\nconst PATH_PATTERN = /\\/company-docs\\/.+\\.md$/;\n\nfor (const item of items) {\n  const content = item.binary?.data?.data\n    ? Buffer.from(item.binary.data.data, 'base64').toString('utf-8')\n    : (item.json.content || '');\n  const filePath = item.json.fileName || item.binary?.data?.fileName || 'unknown';\n  const fileSize = content.length;\n  const fileHash = crypto.createHash('sha256').update(content).digest('hex');\n\n  // Validation\n  const errors = [];\n  if (!PATH_PATTERN.test(filePath)) errors.push('path_pattern_mismatch');\n  if (fileSize > MAX_FILE_BYTES) errors.push('file_too_large');\n  if (fileSize < MIN_CONTENT_LEN) errors.push('content_too_short');\n  if (!content.trim()) errors.push('empty_content');\n\n  const requestId = crypto.randomUUID();\n  const baseEvent = {\n    ts: new Date().toISOString(),\n    source: 'ingestion-v5',\n    request_id: requestId,\n    entity_type: 'document',\n    entity_id: filePath,\n    payload: { file_path: filePath, file_size: fileSize, file_hash: fileHash }\n  };\n\n  if (errors.length > 0) {\n    skipped.push({\n      json: {\n        ...baseEvent,\n        action: 'doc_validation_failed',\n        status: 'skipped',\n        error: errors.join(','),\n        log: JSON.stringify({ level: 'warn', source: 'ingestion-v5', action: 'validation_failed', file: filePath, errors })\n      }\n    });\n  } else {\n    validated.push({\n      json: {\n        ...baseEvent,\n        action: 'doc_validated',\n        status: 'ok',\n        content,\n        file_path: filePath,\n        file_size: fileSize,\n        file_hash: fileHash,\n        log: JSON.stringify({ level: 'info', source: 'ingestion-v5', action: 'validated', file: filePath, size: fileSize, hash: fileHash.slice(0, 12) })\n      },\n      binary: item.binary\n    });\n  }\n}\n\nreturn [...validated, ...skipped];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [576, 528],
      "id": "validate-schema",
      "name": "Validate + Hash"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "loose" },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "is-ok",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": "ok",
              "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [800, 528],
      "id": "if-validated",
      "name": "Valid?"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "tableId": "audit_events",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            { "fieldId": "ts", "fieldValue": "={{ $json.ts }}" },
            { "fieldId": "source", "fieldValue": "={{ $json.source }}" },
            { "fieldId": "action", "fieldValue": "={{ $json.action }}" },
            { "fieldId": "entity_type", "fieldValue": "={{ $json.entity_type }}" },
            { "fieldId": "entity_id", "fieldValue": "={{ $json.entity_id }}" },
            { "fieldId": "request_id", "fieldValue": "={{ $json.request_id }}" },
            { "fieldId": "payload", "fieldValue": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.payload) }}" },
            { "fieldId": "status", "fieldValue": "skipped" },
            { "fieldId": "error", "fieldValue": "={{ $json.error }}" }
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1024, 720],
      "id": "audit-skipped",
      "name": "Audit: Skipped",
      "notes": "Pattern 2: Audit Logs — skipped Docs"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Pattern 6: Circuit Breaker Check (vor jedem externen API-Call)\n// Liest cb_is_open('openai_embeddings') via Supabase RPC\n\n// Hinweis: produktiv via Supabase RPC-Aufruf. Hier vereinfacht: passt durch und\n// die downstream-Nodes haben continueOnFail=true. Bei realem Setup folgt\n// HTTP-Request-Node auf /rest/v1/rpc/cb_is_open mit p_service=openai_embeddings.\n\nconst startTs = Date.now();\nreturn $input.all().map(item => ({\n  json: {\n    ...item.json,\n    cb_checked_at: new Date().toISOString(),\n    cb_service: 'openai_embeddings',\n    cb_state: 'closed',\n    process_started_at: startTs,\n    log: JSON.stringify({ level: 'info', source: 'ingestion-v5', action: 'cb_checked', service: 'openai_embeddings', state: 'closed' })\n  },\n  binary: item.binary\n}));"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1024, 432],
      "id": "check-circuit-breaker",
      "name": "CB Check (OpenAI)"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "tableId": "audit_events",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            { "fieldId": "ts", "fieldValue": "={{ $now.toISO() }}" },
            { "fieldId": "source", "fieldValue": "ingestion-v5" },
            { "fieldId": "action", "fieldValue": "doc_ingestion_started" },
            { "fieldId": "entity_type", "fieldValue": "document" },
            { "fieldId": "entity_id", "fieldValue": "={{ $json.file_path }}" },
            { "fieldId": "request_id", "fieldValue": "={{ $json.request_id }}" },
            { "fieldId": "payload", "fieldValue": "={{ JSON.stringify({ file_path: $json.file_path, file_size: $json.file_size, file_hash: $json.file_hash }) }}" },
            { "fieldId": "status", "fieldValue": "ok" }
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1248, 432],
      "id": "audit-start",
      "name": "Audit: Started",
      "notes": "Pattern 2: Audit Logs — doc_ingestion_started"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "insert",
        "tableName": "documents",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "supabase-vector-insert",
      "name": "Supabase Vector Insert",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.vectorStoreSupabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1472, 432],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "notes": "Continue-on-Error → DLQ"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "text-embedding-3-small",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.embeddingsOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [1440, 624],
      "id": "embeddings-openai",
      "name": "Embeddings OpenAI",
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": { "id": "rOu35isYGAK7PSup", "name": "OpenAI account" }
      },
      "notes": "Pattern 5: Rate-Limit via Retry-Wrapper unter Options"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "textSplittingMode": "custom",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.documentDefaultDataLoader",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1648, 624],
      "id": "default-loader",
      "name": "Default Data Loader"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chunkSize": 500,
        "chunkOverlap": 50,
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.textSplitterRecursiveCharacterTextSplitter",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1648, 832],
      "id": "splitter",
      "name": "Recursive Splitter"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "tableId": "audit_events",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            { "fieldId": "ts", "fieldValue": "={{ $now.toISO() }}" },
            { "fieldId": "source", "fieldValue": "ingestion-v5" },
            { "fieldId": "action", "fieldValue": "doc_ingested" },
            { "fieldId": "entity_type", "fieldValue": "document" },
            { "fieldId": "entity_id", "fieldValue": "={{ $('Validate + Hash').item.json.file_path }}" },
            { "fieldId": "request_id", "fieldValue": "={{ $('Validate + Hash').item.json.request_id }}" },
            { "fieldId": "status", "fieldValue": "ok" },
            { "fieldId": "latency_ms", "fieldValue": "={{ Date.now() - $('CB Check (OpenAI)').item.json.process_started_at }}" },
            { "fieldId": "metadata", "fieldValue": "={{ JSON.stringify({ chunk_count: $json.chunks_inserted || 1, model: 'text-embedding-3-small' }) }}" }
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1712, 320],
      "id": "audit-success",
      "name": "Audit: Ingested",
      "notes": "Pattern 2: Audit Logs — doc_ingested OK"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "tableId": "failed_jobs",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            { "fieldId": "ts", "fieldValue": "={{ $now.toISO() }}" },
            { "fieldId": "source", "fieldValue": "ingestion-v5" },
            { "fieldId": "job_type", "fieldValue": "embed_document" },
            { "fieldId": "payload", "fieldValue": "={{ JSON.stringify({ file_path: $('Validate + Hash').item.json.file_path, file_hash: $('Validate + Hash').item.json.file_hash, content: $('Validate + Hash').item.json.content }) }}" },
            { "fieldId": "error", "fieldValue": "={{ $json.error?.message || $json.error || 'unknown error' }}" },
            { "fieldId": "error_class", "fieldValue": "={{ $json.error?.name || 'IngestionError' }}" },
            { "fieldId": "request_id", "fieldValue": "={{ $('Validate + Hash').item.json.request_id }}" }
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1712, 544],
      "id": "dlq-failed-job",
      "name": "DLQ: Failed Job",
      "notes": "Pattern 3: Dead-Letter Queue"
    },
    {
